# Work documents & private files

Full text: `CLAUDE.md` sections **Work-document** / **Private file and cache** / **Upload and cleanup**.

## Work documents

- Creator-based approval: admin/mod-created work needs ≥1 Ban giám hiệu approver (`WORK_APPROVER_REQUIRED`), stays `pending` until all approve; everyone else's work is released on create (`status: "approved"`)
- Creators: admin/mod + any non-ops level ≥ 2 (`canCreateWorkDocuments`); BGH (4+) assigns any department / lower level, others same department / lower level
- Released = `active && status === "approved"` (`isWorkReleased`); pending/returned work is hidden from assignees (list, chat, file, bell, push)
- First approval locks edit/delete forever, admin/mod included — do **not** lock only on `status === "approved"`; use `convex/workDocumentPolicy.ts`
- Reject (Trả lại, reason required) only while nobody has approved (`canRejectWorkDocument`); edit resets decisions and resubmits
- Approvers = active level 4+ **users**, never admin/moderator
- Otherwise creator may edit/delete until an assignee has submitted (nộp); in-scope admin/mod may still edit
- Completions: assignee **Nộp** (web requires evidence file); only the **creator** marks complete / returns
- Soft-delete first; inactive docs must deny access even if Drive cleanup lags
- File replace is staged: publish DB only after new upload validates; never delete old Drive object before DB success

## Private files / cache

- New uploads = private Drive; Convex keeps identity/checksum/metadata, not public links
- Never return Drive or Convex Storage URLs to the browser; always `/api/files/:documentId` after auth
- Legacy `fileId` uses the same gateway + 24-hour server cache as Drive
- Authorize before serving shared cache or client local cache; metadata `private, no-store`
- Version via SHA-256 `fileVersion` when possible; stale local content must not bypass auth/version failure
- Purpose-scoped cleanup (`work` vs `people-review`); no cross-module auth fallback

## Verify

- Web/backend: `npm test` + `npm run build:production`
- UIKit (when scoped): `xcodebuild` gate in `CLAUDE.md`
